  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Kokkinos, on Lemnos GRE</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "At Kokkinos (or K\u00f3tsinas) on Lemnos there is a mound-like promontory that projects into the Bay of Pourni\u00e1. Here was a once important Byzantine/Venetian castle that occupied the site of an earlier, Classical settlement.",
